<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's Jan 17 net foreign reserves $9.88 bln.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Jan 17 net foreign reserves $9.88 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's net foreign reserves stood at $9.88 billion as of Jan. 17, the latest date for which official figures are available, the central bank said.</p>
<p>It said the figure marked a $1.7 million increase over the last official cutoff date, on Jan. 10.</p>
<p>Colombia's net foreign reserves reached a record-high $9.89 billion on Dec. 30 but had contracted by $9.9 million as of Jan. 17.</p>
<p>((-- Javier Mozzo, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
